aid, as may be required.\r\n4. To transact any other incidental and ancillary business with the permission of the Chairperson.", "NEWSID": "29dca315-575d-4a89-972e-1acd9da68d42", "NEWSSUB": "Board Meeting Intimation for Considering And Approving The Unaudited Financial Results For The Quarter And Half Year Ended September 30, 2026 And Fund Raising By Way Of Preferential Issue / Private Placement, And Convening An EGM", "NEWS_DT": "2026-11-09T19:59:34.92", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/kumbhat-financial-services-ltd/kumpfin/526869/", "News_submission_dt": "2026-11-09T19:59:33", "OLD": 1, "PDFFLAG": 1, "QUARTER_ID": null, "RN": 1, "SCRIP_CD": 526869, "SLONGNAME": "Kumbhat Financial Services Ltd", "SUBCATNAME": "Board Meeting", "TimeDiff": "00:00:01", "XML_NAME": "ANN_526869_29DCA315-575D-4A89-972E-1ACD9DA68D42"}]